# Unconstrained array accepts unrelated subtypes

Verifies a declared `int[]` accepts values from different measure dimensions
when their base type matches and preserves every stored subtype on access.

>>> source
let values: int[] = [10mm, 5kg, 2s]
print(values[0])
print(values[1])
print(values[2])

<<< stdout
10mm
5kg
2s

<<< stderr
